if(A.dB(g,A.a(["blood test","lab","results","hormone test"],k)))return"A lab is a snapshot with a range, a date, and a reason. The words on the report are written for clinicians, so EVA translates the name and leaves the verdict alone.\n\nName the marker \u2014 ferritin, TSH, estradiol, progesterone, AMH \u2014 and the cycle day if you know it. The note explains what the test is trying to see. This reply will not tell you that you are normal, sick, fertile, or infertile."
if(A.dB(g,A.a(["discharge","mucus","cervical"],k)))return"Discharge changes across a cycle. Clear and stretchy fluid often shows up near the fertile window. White or creamy fluid is common. Brown at the edges of a period is often older blood.\n\nColor alone cannot diagnose an infection. Yellow-green or gray discharge, a strong odor, itching, burning, or pelvic pain are reasons to see a clinician. A note can describe it. This reply will not name an infection from a sentence."
