B.a5H=new A.lg("How EVA works","Educational guidance. Not a doctor, not a diagnosis, not contraception. If this is an emergency, call local emergency services. In the US or Canada, call or text 988. Outside the US and Canada, use a local crisis line. A directory of local lines is at findahelpline.com. This app is not the emergency service. A cycle day appears only after you save a period date. Nothing here is a measurement.",!1)
B.a5C=new A.lg("Five places","The bar along the bottom is the whole app. Today is home. Rhythm is the calendar and the log. Ask is where you type a question. Twin is a hormone sketch, not a lab. You holds your name, focus, and privacy.",!1)
B.a5G=new A.lg("Today","Your name is at the top. Log period is the card under your name: tap the day bleeding started. All features is the list under that card, and every place in EVA is named there. One tap logs flow and mood. Those taps save only what you choose.",!1)
B.a5B=new A.lg("Rhythm, Ask, and Twin","Log period opens a calendar. Tap the day bleeding started. Rhythm stays quiet until that date is saved. Ask marks ordinary replies as educational guidance. Twin draws a sketch and stamps it SKETCH. It is not a blood test.",!1)
B.a5E=new A.lg("Partner sharing","The bar under the emergency line is partner sharing. Link your partner creates a one-time code that expires in 48 hours. I am a partner pastes the copied message on their own phone. They see the current phase, a daily tip, and three ways to help. Notes, symptoms, and Ask stay here. Stop sharing ends it on this phone. Their phone keeps that copy until the 48 hours end.",!1)
B.a5D=new A.lg("Every feature","These open from All features on Today. Each one keeps the same limit: guidance, not a diagnosis.",!0)
B.a5F=new A.lg("Your data","Notes stay on this device until you delete them. You can export a copy, download the file, or erase the profile from You and from Privacy. Start when you want Today.",!1)
B.Nr=s([B.a5H,B.a5C,B.a5G,B.a5B,B.a5E,B.a5D,B.a5F],A.ai("v<lg>"))
